profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199520120135/", "num_games_owned": 33, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 3156, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2848, "last_played": 1786136332, "avatar": "37845f936c540d3acd3cbd70912bb040d748dd9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love the game, the gameplay is so good, and is just the beta. I can not wait for the full release", "timestamp_created": 1711235665, "timestamp_updated": 1711235665, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161301129", "author": {"steamid": "76561198263496027", "personaname": "DXG", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kemealreadyinusesemua/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 38203, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 687, "last_played": 1786403328, "avatar": "ab1a827e2157192266669d17b1f4eaf112d52b09"}, "language": "english", "review": "i hope digimon make game like this", "timestamp_created": 1711235145, "timestamp_updated": 1711235145, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161300623", "author": {"steamid": "76561199013666099", "personaname": "SleepyEspe ❤U", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199013666099/", "num_games_owned": 129, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 33349, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2236, "last_played": 1787092839, "avatar": "b4561e5dd53c5ab0b91244e22074f444ece47d28"}, "language": "english", "review": "In shortcut, this game is so fun and addicting. especially if u have friends to play with <3. The map is so wide and there are a lot of places and caves to explore, each place has its own Pals \"lighting, dark, water, ice, fire, rocks, plants and more\", and pals have different lvls and sometimes you might encounter giant pals. As for the crafting system, it's so simple compared to other survival games <3 and there's a lot of things to do in the game so u will never feel bored. Lastly, u might encounter some bugs but that's okay because the game is still early access, and i would still give it 10/10 . ^^ <3", "timestamp_created": 1711234657, "timestamp_updated": 1711234657, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.547325074672698975", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161300331", "author": {"steamid": "76561198825289784", "personaname": "dylan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198825289784/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3782, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1820, "last_played": 1784529018, "avatar": "20874b7ad628054e21eeac9b29fac38d661a0efe"}, "language": "english", "review": "if you do mods its super hard", "timestamp_created": 1711234365, "timestamp_updated": 1711234365, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161298613", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009634062", "personaname": "Get Squinkies", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bloopybopper/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 550, "playtime_forever": 765, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 765, "last_played": 1730401717, "avatar": "f1828607eac4054560a02da9ba83e4310053661a"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDIT: LMAO ULTRAKILL!?!?!\n\nHype is a b****, but this is relaxing, cute, nice visuals, and fun enough.  Impressive amount of animations for the pokemon.", "timestamp_created": 1711232779, "timestamp_updated": 1766119471, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161298414", "author": {"steamid": "76561198094408358", "personaname": "Chosen One of the Invisible Ark", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CrippledWings/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 757, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 741, "deck_playtime_at_review": 521, "last_played": 1772754745, "avatar": "e65b336190b64e3545ceb90cbf4922668a1d1bff"}, "language": "english", "review": "I am a 45 yo father, probably one of the oldest people playing this game. I am a single farther to my Son, who is 14 now. My son got this game for Christmas in 2022 from his uncle, so we installed it on his computer and he started playing. By the end of the week he had 24 hours on this game. This was horrible for me, as it was already hard for me to find ways to spend time with my son, as he is always out with his friends or just watching YouTube. So I decided to make a Steam account and get this game to see if I could maybe play alongside him. I loaded into the game, picked my character and started playing but I was stuck on what you where supposed to do. I asked my Son for help and he hosted a game for me to join. I loved it as it was the best time I had spent with my Son since my wife had died. This game has ever since brought me and my son closer again and now we actually spend time together outside the house together as well. This game reminded me that there's fun to be had in everything, and it has brought both me and my Son many happy memories.", "timestamp_created": 1711232601, "timestamp_updated": 1711232601, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50919806957244873", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161297706", "author": {"steamid": "76561199236156323", "personaname": "ZombieOutRunner", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199236156323/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7805, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6732, "last_played": 1715884443, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like it.", "timestamp_created": 1711231973, "timestamp_updated": 1711231973, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161297378", "author": {"steamid": "76561198849072269", "personaname": "Devildog235467", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198849072269/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 20848, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9476, "last_played": 1724910063, "avatar": "14